{"id":"loi-noi-gian-tiep-qua-khu","lv":"b2","n":6,"cat":"clauses","t":"Lời nói gián tiếp ở quá khứ (hoà hợp thì)","en":"il a dit qu'il était fatigué · elle m'a demandé si j'avais fini","kind":"contrast","sum":"Khi động từ dẫn ở quá khứ (il a dit, elle a demandé), thì trong câu thuật lại lùi một bậc: présent → imparfait, passé composé → plus-que-parfait, futur → conditionnel présent, futur proche → allait + nguyên mẫu. Imparfait, plus-que-parfait, conditionnel giữ nguyên. Từ chỉ thời gian cũng đổi: demain → le lendemain, hier → la veille, aujourd'hui → ce jour-là.","forms":[{"f":"présent → imparfait","vi":"Il a dit qu'il était fatigué."},{"f":"passé composé → plus-que-parfait","vi":"Elle a dit qu'elle avait fini."},{"f":"futur → conditionnel","vi":"Il a dit qu'il viendrait."},{"f":"demain → le lendemain · hier → la veille","vi":"Il a dit qu'il partirait le lendemain."}],"pts":[{"id":"reported-past","name":"Discours indirect au passé","vi":"Lời nói gián tiếp ở quá khứ, hoà hợp thì: présent → imparfait, passé composé → plus-que-parfait, futur → conditionnel; demain → le lendemain, hier → la veille"}],"cast":{"lea":{"name":{"en":"Léa","vi":"Léa"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#D9774F","topShade":"#BF6340","accent":"#C8603B","hair":"long","hairColor":"#6B4226"},"x":1040},"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":560}},"bg":"restaurant","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Alors, qu'est-ce que la directrice t'a dit hier ?","vi":"Thế hôm qua bà giám đốc nói gì với em?","ipa":["alɔʁ","kɛs","kə","la","diʁɛktʁis","ta","di","jɛʁ"],"who":"nam","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":2.766,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,1.104],[2,1.328],[3,1.429],[4,1.528],[5,2.104],[6,2.241],[7,2.391]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Elle m'a dit qu'elle était contente de mon travail et qu'elle me d